definitions.doc:
Measure whether forgotten memories were appropriate.

forgotten_records: list of {memory_id, content, forgotten_at_turn, reason}
probe_records: list of {memory_id, probe_turn, retrieved (bool)}

methods.doc:
Send one request, retrying only according to the immutable config.

The keyword compatibility parameters are retained for thin legacy callers;
canonical runtime code passes ``generation_config``.
